      "pinyin": "zài shàng hǎi rén mín gōng yuán de yì jiǎo měi zhōu liù dōu huì jǔ bàn yí cì zhēng hūn huó dòng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "在相亲角挂满了上百张相亲牌，这些相亲牌的内容包括年龄、职业、住房、收入等，",
      "traditional": "在相親角掛滿了上百張相親牌，這些相親牌的內容包括年齡、職業、住房、收入等，",
      "pinyin": "zài xiāng qīn jiǎo guà mǎn le shàng bǎi zhāng xiāng qīn pái zhè xiē xiāng qīn pái de nèi róng bāo kuò nián líng zhí yè zhù fáng shōu rù děng",
      "english": "Every Saturday in a corner of the People’s Park in Shanghai, there are Chinese people engaging in the local “matchmaking activities”."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "各种要求都一目了然。",
      "traditional": "各種要求都一目了然。",
      "pinyin": "gè zhǒng yāo qiú dōu yí mù liǎo rán",
      "english": "The matchmaking corner is full of hundreds of cards containing the age, occupation, property, and income of all potential marriage partners."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "这些相亲牌大多是年轻人的父母带过去的，而非年轻人本身。",
      "traditional": "這些相親牌大多是年輕人的父母帶過去的，而非年輕人本身。",
      "pinyin": "zhè xiē xiāng qīn pái dà duō shì nián qīng rén de fù mǔ dài guò qù de ér fēi nián qīng rén běn shēn",
      "english": "You are also supposed to write what you expect of a future partner."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "父母因为担心子女的婚姻问题，所以希望通过这种方式为子女物色到合适的约会对象。",
      "traditional": "父母因為擔心子女的婚姻問題，所以希望通過這種方式為子女物色到合適的約會對象。",
      "pinyin": "fù mǔ yīn wèi dān xīn zǐ nǚ de hūn yīn wèn tí suǒ yǐ xī wàng tōng guò zhè zhǒng fāng shì wèi zǐ nǚ wù sè dào hé shì de yuē huì duì xiàng",
      "english": "The parents, not the young people, bring most of the cards."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The parents are worried that their children will not get married and by doing this are trying to find suitable dates for them."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "今年6月，“甘道夫”---77岁的英国演员伊恩· 麦克莱恩也来到上海人民公园的相亲角，",
      "traditional": "今年6月，“甘道夫”---77歲的英國演員伊恩· 麥克萊恩也來到上海人民公園的相親角，",
