      "pinyin": "guà shàng le zì jǐ de xiāng qīn pái shēn gāo wǔ yīng chǐ yòu shí yī nián líng 3 lún dūn yǒu fáng jiàn qiáo dà xué bì yè",
      "english": "This year in June, “Gandalf” - the 77-year-old British actor Ian McKellen visited the matchmaking corner in the People's Park."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "看来，这位老爷子掌握了在中国相亲的“精髓”内容呢！",
      "traditional": "看來，這位老爺子掌握了在中國相親的“精髓”內容呢！",
      "pinyin": "kàn lái zhè wèi lǎo yé zi zhǎng wò le zài zhōng guó xiāng qīn de jīng suǐ nèi róng ne",
      "english": "He put up his “card”: 5'11\", 77 years, house in London, Cambridge University."
    },
