    "sentence_translations": [
      "Marriage Market in Shanghai",
      "",
      "Every Saturday in a corner of the People’s Park in Shanghai, there are Chinese people engaging in the local “matchmaking activities”.",
      "The matchmaking corner is full of hundreds of cards containing the age, occupation, property, and income of all potential marriage partners.",
      "You are also supposed to write what you expect of a future partner.",
      "The parents, not the young people, bring most of the cards.",
      "The parents are worried that their children will not get married and by doing this are trying to find suitable dates for them.",
      "",
      "This year in June, “Gandalf” - the 77-year-old British actor Ian McKellen visited the matchmaking corner in the People's Park.",
      "He put up his “card”: 5'11\", 77 years, house in London, Cambridge University.",
      "It seems that the old man has captured the very essence of dating in China!",
      ""
    ]
  }
